en.existant.texte:
ComfyUI is already installed here:
{dossier}

If you continue, Stillive is ADDED to this ComfyUI:
- a "stillive_nodes" folder is copied into its custom_nodes folder;
- a few missing small Python tools are added to this ComfyUI's Python;
- later, the preparation page downloads the photo analysis and the video models (about {go} GB). A model you already have (H3 or any other) is not downloaded again, and Stillive will never delete it.

Nothing else is changed: your ComfyUI, your workflows and your models stay as they are. Stillive does not start a second ComfyUI.

If your ComfyUI is open, close it before continuing, then restart it after the installation.

Yes: I only add Stillive.
No: I do nothing and you can pick another folder.

